  <section class="approach-section"><div class="container approach-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">A PERSONAL APPROACH</p><h2>Start where<br /><em>you are.</em></h2></div><div><p class="large-copy">A complete plan or a first spark of inspiration. Both are welcome.</p><p>M&amp;H Construction focuses on kitchen and bathroom remodeling in Brazos County. We can work with homeowner ideas and existing plans, with design assistance considered according to each project.</p><p>Our primary service area includes Bryan and College Station. Projects farther out are considered based on scope.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Start a Conversation <Arrow /></a></div></div></section>
